# Bundled Whisper model weights (~140 MB; TextDecoder weight.bin alone is 99.3 MiB, which is
# within a rounding error of GitHub's 100 MiB hard limit). Kept out of the repository exactly as
# in the sibling VisualAcuityTest_ETDRS app. WhisperKitLetterRecognitionService prefers this
# folder when present and otherwise falls back to WhisperKit.download(variant:) on first launch.
# See docs/TESTING.md § "Speech model (WhisperKit)".
Sources/Resources/WhisperModels/*
!Sources/Resources/WhisperModels/.keep

